        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Typical way of life or manner of living characteristic of an individual or group. (From APA, Thesaurus of Psychological Index Terms, 8th ed) (MSH)
 A manner of living that reflects the person&apos;s values and attitudes. (NCI)
 Typical way of life or manner of living characteristic of an individual or groups. (PSY)
