        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An abnormality of mental functioning including various affective, behavioural, cognitive and perceptual abnormalities. [HPO:probinson] (HPO)
 Detectable changes in behavior due to psychotherapeutic, behavioral, or other intervention, or spontaneous occurrence. (PSY)
