        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The pattern of a person&apos;s emotional, romantic, and/or sexual attractions. (NCI)
 Direction of one&apos;s sexual interest toward members of the same, opposite, or both sexes; involves feelings, and sense of identity. (CSP)
 https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0205949</skos:definition>
