        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The sexual attraction or relationship between members of both the same and the opposite SEX. (MSH)
 A sexual attraction to members of both sexes. (NCI)
 https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0005639</skos:definition>
        <UMLS_CUI rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">C0005639</UMLS_CUI>
