 A sexual attraction to members of the opposite sex. (NCI)
 https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0019421</skos:definition>
        <UMLS_CUI rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">C0019421</UMLS_CUI>
