        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The sexual attraction or relationship between members of the same SEX. (MSH)
 A sexual attraction to members of the same sex. (NCI)
 Sexual attraction or relationship between members of the same sex. (CSP)
 https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0019900</skos:definition>
        <UMLS_CUI rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">C0019900</UMLS_CUI>
