        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Stress arising from personal financial concerns. (https://www.cancer.gov/publications/dictionaries/cancer-terms/def/financial-stress). (MSH)
 Refers to the costs required to deal with a specific situation (e.g., disease burden). (NCI)
 https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C5392146</skos:definition>
        <UMLS_CUI rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">C5392146</UMLS_CUI>
