        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Elementary school completed--no high school. Grade 8 or equivalent completed.
 Elementary school means grades 1 through 8, or equivalent.
 https://dw.opm.gov/datastandards/referenceData/1435/current?index=E
 BUT TO MATCH COMMON SENSE, ELEMENTRY COVERS ONLY UP TO 5TH GRADE
</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Elementary_School_Completed</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


