        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The unfair treatment of a person or group based on class or category bias. (NCI)
 https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C2987623</skos:definition>
        <UMLS_CUI rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">C2987623</UMLS_CUI>
